WEBVTT

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.250
I've had enough!

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.340
Give me my money back!

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.480
What's going on?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.830
I'm going home!

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.540
Even I want to complain.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.800
I don't know who's dueling, I don't 
know who's winning or losing.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.000
I can't do the play-by-play!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.740
C'mon!  Let me work!

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:26.070
Pretty please?

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.540
LDS's chairwoman wasn't lying.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:34.240
The eight members of Youth Team 
are having a battle royal.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.780
What does “lost” mean?

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:40.250
They must have lost their duels 
and their Pendulum Cards.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.250
Layra won.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.720
Look.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.820
It's just as she said.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.620
I'm facing Layra in the finals.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.900
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.150
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.320
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.060
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.730
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:19.540
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:30.650
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:36.120
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:41.730
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.860
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.800
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.130
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:59.410
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.850
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.850
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:14.930
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:25.440
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:28.140
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.840
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.640
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.390
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:44.980
Joeri with the Chilling Smile

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.030
Oh, it's you.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:55.390
I was getting tired waiting for you.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:57.660
You finally came, Joeri.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.320
Did you find her?

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.770
Of course!  Awhile ago.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.000
She's already surrounded.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.900
Why are they here?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:15.070
The Professor only ordered 
me to bring Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.170
That's a good question.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.880
But the answer is simple.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.420
Yuzu recently changed clothes with Serena.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:25.080
Obelisk Force is after Serena.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.890
They look similar, like you and Yuya.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.590
Who's Yuya?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.680
Someone from this dimension 
who looks like you-

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.420
That was scary!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.000
You were going too fast.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.660
You're the one who wanted to ride it!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.110
But we found duelists.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:56.320
Aww, you saw me.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.280
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:02.280
I can ask you the same thing.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.260
You're in my way.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:19.060
Serena must meet Kurosaki to learn 
what happened in the Xyz Dimension.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.110
Therefore, I'll draw their attention.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.350
Those Duel Disks are from 
the Fusion Dimension.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.360
Okay then.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.110
I'll take you on!

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.910
You're also in my way.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.370
Yuya!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.800
What are you talking about?

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.510
That's not my name.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.690
You three, move out of the way.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.640
If you interfere, this will happen to you.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.910
What's this?

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:10.140
What?  People are sealed inside cards?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.800
No way!

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:14.400
Do you know them?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.200
I'm sorry.  They were 
interfering with my job.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.480
I'll give those back to you.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:25.840
Hugo is another guy who looks like me.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.800
He's Hugo?

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.740
You did this?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:32.820
Yes.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.280
Why?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.000
Because they were interfering.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.920
How dare you turn people into cards!

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.400
If you complain...

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.450
I'll also turn you into a card.

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.600
But I won't.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.650
The Professor will be mad if I act on my own.

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:50.830
The Professor?

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:55.530
At Academia, the Professor's 
orders are final.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.500
You're also from Academia?

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.330
Yes I am.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.740
You really do look like Ruri and Rin.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.710
Ruri and Rin?

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.120
So the one who kidnapped Ruri is...

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.180
Yeah, me.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.180
Why did you do that?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.040
Because it was the Professor's orders.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.900
I'm currently following the 
Professor's orders too.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.840
He ordered to bring you with me.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.920
Me?  Why?

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.380
I don't know.  I just obey.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.630
Anyway, the Professor is waiting.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:46.050
You're feisty, just like Ruri and Rin.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.300
Then how's this:

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.850
I'll duel you.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.700
If I win, you do what I say.  Okay?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:56.910
Wait a sec!  Other than Ruri, 
you also kidnapped Rin?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:57.720
Why?

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.690
Like I said, those were my orders.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:00.910
Hurry up.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.540
Just like how you were eager 
to take on Obelisk Force.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.240
I...

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.240
If you won't come after 
me, I'll come after you.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.840
I won't be defeated easily!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.310
I'll leave this to Joeri.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.680
You're going to help me.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.190
What's this?

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.020
First the Ice Age, now a fiery hell?

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.080
What's going on in this world?

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.560
Don't do it!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.180
What's that?

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:50.000
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Ancient Armageddon Gear from my hand!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:55.920
And due to Triple Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound's effect, it can attack three times!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.400
Your monster is first!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.180
Go!  Battle!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.280
Attack Naturia Leodrake!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:07.030
Then due to Double Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound's effect,

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:13.310
it destroys a monster with a Gear Acid 
Counter without calculating damage.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.900
Due to Ancient Armageddon Gear's effect,

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:28.290
you take damage equal to the destroyed 
monster's attack points for 3000 points of damage.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:40.060
Don't do it!  Help me!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:57.130
Due to the same effect, you 
take 3500 points of damage!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.710
They're...

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.270
They're doing the same thing here!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.740
This is the end!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.630
Attack Hierophant of Prophecy!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.620
Stop it!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.430
Intruder in the Volcano Area!

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.900
He's not a duelist from the Fusion Dimension!

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:50.870
Is he from Synchro Dimension?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.110
I Special Summon Speedroid 
Menko from my hand!

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:08.550
Its effect switches all your 
monsters to defense position!

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.330
This doesn't help.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.560
I end my turn.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.550
Who are you?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.880
I'm Hugo.

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.810
Fusion?  You're our teammate?
(Note: "Hugo" and "Fusion" sound similar in Japanese.)

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.820
I said I'm Hugo!
(Note: "Hugo" and "Fusion" sound similar in Japanese.)

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.680
My turn!

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:33.510
I summon Speedroid Tri-Eyed 
Dice from my hand!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:44.160
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice tunes Level 4 Menko!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:55.770
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings to 
strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:57.610
Synchro Summon!

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:02.780
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.280
Synchro Dragon!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:14.010
When a monster is summoned 
or Special Summoned,

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:20.240
Double Ancient Gear Hunting Hound 
places a Gear Acid Counter on it!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:23.950
Your dragon will meet the 
same fate as the others!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.420
Are you sure about that?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.290
What?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.360
When a Level 5-or-above 
monster activates its effect,

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:33.680
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon negates 
and destroys that monster!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.520
Dichroic Mirror!

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.290
His own card hurt him!

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:52.370
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon gains attack points 
equal to the destroyed monster's attack points!

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.600
Prepare yourself.  This is the end!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:59.990
I activate the spell card 
Synchro Cracker from my hand!

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.980
I return Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon to my Extra Deck

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:07.070
to destroy all monsters with 
equal or fewer attack points!

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:10.200
Your own card will destroy you!

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.540
Ancient Armageddon Gear's effect!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:17.140
You take damage equal to the 
destroyed monsters' attack points!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.860
He beat multiple opponents at once!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:27.340
Synchro isn't the enemy?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.620
Are you okay?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.700
We're not capable of fighting these battles!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.880
Hey!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:43.290
Sheesh, he didn't thank me for saving him.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.970
The elite Youth Team couldn't do anything.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:48.150
President, we have to send Top Team!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.100
That's pointless.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:53.510
LDS currently doesn't have the 
power to stop Academia's duelists.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.100
We don't know unless we try!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:13:01.900
Did you forget why I decided 
to form the Lancers?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:08.200
When Pendulum Summoning appeared, 
dueling entered a new stage.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:14.230
The skills we've learned so far aren't 
enough against duelists from other dimensions.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:22.170
But the Junior Youth and lower classes 
who make up the Yuya Sakaki generation...

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.520
They willingly accept Pendulum Summoning,

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.710
so they have the potential 
to become even stronger.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.780
What's up with you, Reiji Akaba!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.580
Sawatari!  How did you get in here?

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.110
Where's security?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:36.580
My papa's influence took care of that.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.890
Anyway, what's going on?

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:41.270
Why won't you show the battle royal?

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:42.900
You want to see it?

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.680
Of course.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:50.440
Since he defeated me, I need to 
see how far Yuya Sakaki can go.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:54.710
I see.  Then I'll only allow you to watch.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:56.150
President?

00:13:56.550 --> 00:14:00.910
Shingo Sawatari, do you want a second chance?

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.220
Second chance?

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.710
There are two souls inside me.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.250
One is me.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.660
Ute, you're the other one, right?

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:26.050
When Academia showed up and turned 
Knight of Duels into cards,

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.170
I witnessed the tragedy at Xyz Dimension.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:33.800
Did that anger and sadness 
drag me into the shadows?

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:37.060
But I remember what you said.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:45.080
Use your power to bring smiles 
to the world and the future.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.050
Those words weren't lies.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.280
That means Ute isn't the 
one making me lose control.

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:58.240
I was able to see another soul and a 
black shadow hiding further beyond.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:02.360
I don't know what the black shadow is.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:07.120
If something that I don't know 
is making me lose control...

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.880
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:15.160
If you want to win, then have 
courage and step forward.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:17.390
That's right.  I can't be scared.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:25.950
No matter what evil resides in my heart, 
I'll believe in myself and Ute who's inside me!

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:35.240
If we combine our strengths, 
there's no way we'll lose to them!

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:40.550
I promise to duel and win to bring 
smiles to the world and the future!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.520
I'm not alone!

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:47.600
Everyone, it's morning!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:49.430
Let's have breakfast.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:57.700
Delicious!  Michy's cooking is the best!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.780
It's just a simple meal I 
made with whatever we had.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.660
No, it's well done.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.540
You're great at dueling and cooking.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.920
You're the best partner ever!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:10.950
Thanks to your cooking, Yuya 
has regained his strength.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:15.120
The man Gongenzaka thanks you, Michy.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.280
Enough with Michy!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:22.550
Mieru can cook a delicious 
meal for her darling too!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:23.400
Hey!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:27.200
What's with her?  Where's she going?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.350
To look for ingredients?

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.970
Anyway, she's not in the 
battle royal, is she?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.820
It's not just Mieru.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:39.810
There are many other duelists who've 
invaded the Junior Youth Championship.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.520
Sora is here.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.040
Sora came back?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.150
Yeah, along with Academia.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.000
I'm no match for him.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.270
Wow, it's already morning.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.370
You're incredible for eluding me for so long.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:08.630
Congratulations.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.750
But hide-and-seek is over.  Come out.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:16.860
Come with me to the Professor.

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.860
Can you come out soon?

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.540
I can no longer escape!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.830
Save me, Yuya!

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.290
What?

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.040
It's glowing again?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.250
Is Yuya really coming to save me?

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:49.840
Rin?

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.220
Rin!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.430
I'm glad you're safe!  I 
wanted to see you, Rin!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.380
Wait!  I'm not Rin!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:05.970
You're just like Ruri and Rin.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:09.120
You know who Rin is?

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.860
That's Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.160
After making lovey-dovey eyes at my darling,

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.780
she changes her clothes to 
secretly meet with another man!

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.690
I won't forgive her!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:36.960
Hey Yuya!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:39.700
Dennis!

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:41.910
How are things going?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.870
I dueled Yuzu and won.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.130
Yuzu?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:45.970
Where?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.260
In the Volcano Area.  Why?

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:52.850
The sixteen of us aren't the only 
ones battling in the battle royal.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.040
There are others?

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.120
Yeah.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:19:00.470
You might not believe it, but there 
are duelists from other dimensions!

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:01.500
Other dimensions?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.170
What's up with that?

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:07.030
It's true!  Among them is my friend Sora!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.500
Sora?

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:12.230
Wow!  You have a friend 
from another dimension?

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.910
I saw them defeat Knight 
of Duels with my own eyes!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:21.710
Communications don't work inside this 
field, so we can't contact the others.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.900
So we decided to split up to find everyone.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.260
Wow!  This is big trouble!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.880
Yuzu said that she was 
going to the Iceberg Area.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:30.880
Let's search there!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.370
Do I know Rin?

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:36.540
What?

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:37.550
It's glowing again.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.310
It's no good.  Yuzu isn't-

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.030
She's not here.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:50.330
Did she go to another area?

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.890
It seems Joeri successfully 
completed his job.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.700
What's left to do is...

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.330
My turn!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:16.750
Do you think you've won?  How naïve!

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:19.760
I activate Fluffal Mouse's effect!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.440
When this monster is in attack position,

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:27.280
I can Special Summon two 
Fluffal Mice from my deck!

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.570
Here I go!

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:33.110
The fun is only getting started!

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:38.200
I fuse Edge Imp Sabres 
and three Fluffal Mice!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.240
Devil's claws and sharp fangs!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:46.050
Become one in the whirlpool of mystery!  
Show your new power and look!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:49.040
Fusion Summon!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:54.480
Appear, the magical forest beast 
that tears through everything!

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:57.400
Frightfur Tiger!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:01.240
Frightfur Tiger's effect activates!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:06.300
For every fused monster, one 
of your monsters is destroyed!

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.510
What?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.910
The remaining Force Strix's 
attack points return to normal.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.750
Right?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:34.260
Frightfur Tiger gains 300 attack 
points for every Frightfur monster!

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:38.470
This is the end!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:41.710
Go!  Battle, Frightfur Tiger!

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:44.220
Attack Force Strix!

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:48.380
Finish Kurosaki, the Xyz refugee!

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:49.850
Kurosaki?

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:32.870
As long as there's a smile

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:39.640
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:44.950
I always believe

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:48.470
In my tomorrow

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:54.100
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:02.730
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:09.610
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:16.280
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:20.350
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:49.040
Syun Kurosaki, I win this time.

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:50.480
You're badly hurt!

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:52.050
Move out of the way, Yuzu.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:54.770
Kurosaki is my prey.

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:57.110
The spell card Lunar Eclipse!

00:23:57.110 --> 00:23:59.310
Shadows envelop the field!

00:23:59.310 --> 00:24:02.800
What?  That's Academia's Duel Disk!

00:24:02.800 --> 00:24:04.480
Are you Serena?

00:24:04.490 --> 00:24:06.090
Stop, Serena!

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:10.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Wounded Falcon

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.960
The fun is only getting started!
